  "post_content": "<p>El colectivo literario Verba Manent de Castell&oacute;n ha organizado esta ma&ntilde;ana una marcha de senderismo literario por los montes de Suera, para llegar a la Fuente de Castro, donde se ha realizado una lectura de poemas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_77061.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La actividad se enmarca dentro del VI Festival Internacional de Poes&iacute;a Palabra en el mundo, que se desarrolla del 10 al 22 de mayo. Las personas que&nbsp;componen el coletivo literario Verba Manent hab&iacute;an realizado una primera quedada a las 9.30 horas en&nbsp;la plaza Maria Agustina de Castell&oacute;. A las 11 han salido de Suera por el camino de Pedralba hacia el Castillo de Mauz. Han visitado tambi&eacute;n Suera Alta para llegar a la Fuente de Castro, donde tras el almuerzo se ha celebrado una jam po&eacute;tica, en la que tambi&eacute;n ha participado el versador local Pascual Garc&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7697.jpg\" alt=\"img_7697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7698.jpg\" alt=\"img_7698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7699.jpg\" alt=\"img_7699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7700.jpg\" alt=\"img_7700\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7701.jpg\" alt=\"img_7701\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7702.jpg\" alt=\"img_7702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7704.jpg\" alt=\"img_7704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7705.jpg\" alt=\"img_7705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7706.jpg\" alt=\"img_7706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7707.jpg\" alt=\"img_7707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7708.jpg\" alt=\"img_7708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7710.jpg\" alt=\"img_7710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7703.jpg\" alt=\"img_7703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7709.jpg\" alt=\"img_7709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/senderismepoeticsuerabona/img_7703_0.jpg\" alt=\"img_7703_0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
